     "content_html": "international issues had largely been handled successfully by the Articles"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168089,
     "content_html": "the authority and jurisdiction of the Federal Government needed to be augmented"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168086,
     "content_html": "the alliance with France needed to be discontinued because it was a monarchy"
    }
